    "name": "Frontline Inferno",
    "steam_appid": 3177070,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177070/extras/e1b8d8ae255266f003b88a8584195793.avif?t=1738975539\" width=616 height=180 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the boots of a soldier from the Axis, Soviet, or Allied forces and engage in thrilling, rapid-fire battles across colorful, stylized battlegrounds. <i>Frontline Inferno</i> is an action-packed FPS arena shooter that combines the historical setting of World War II with an arcade twist, delivering frantic gunfights, instant respawns, and total freedom in how you gear up.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177070/extras/b1839b3b9d12cccac51b4b17e42e4b30.avif?t=1738975539\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-stop, fast-paced combat</strong> \u2013 The action never slows down. Sprint, shoot, and respawn as quickly as you fall, keeping the gameplay constantly intense and dynamic. Whether you're flanking or charging head-on, there\u2019s no time to breathe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vertical, multi-layered maps</strong> \u2013 Battle across uniquely designed arenas inspired by real WWII locations. From bombed-out cities to underground bunkers, each map offers vertical gameplay and dynamic layouts that keep players on their toes. Master the environment to gain the upper hand!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vibrant low-poly visuals</strong> \u2013 Forget gritty realism \u2013 <i>Frontline Inferno</i> delivers the war in bright, bold, and colorful low-poly graphics that bring a playful and approachable vibe to the intensity of the action. It\u2019s World War II like you\u2019ve never seen it before.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable characters</strong> \u2013 Stand out from the crowd with a variety of customization options. From helmets and uniforms to accessories, personalize your soldier's look and hit the battlefield in style.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177070/extras/e9f5ded1e6f836399a56a8246fc6ff1a.avif?t=1738975539\" width=616 height=180 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience frantic multiplayer deathmatches where you choose your side in a battle between Axis, Soviets, and Allies. Join the fight in team-based skirmishes across small, intense maps designed for high-octane combat. No complex strategies \u2013 just raw, arcade action.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177070/extras/6e886195ce00811648796e351725b1e4.avif?t=1738975539\" width=616 height=180 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Frontline Inferno</i> is perfect for players who crave fast-paced, skill-based shooters with a nostalgic arcade feel. Ideal for both casual gamers looking to jump into quick, action-packed sessions and FPS veterans who love chaotic, no-holds-barred gameplay.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177070/extras/e1b8d8ae255266f003b88a8584195793.avif?t=1738975539\" width=616 height=180 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the boots of a soldier from the Axis, Soviet, or Allied forces and engage in thrilling, rapid-fire battles across colorful, stylized battlegrounds. <i>Frontline Inferno</i> is an action-packed FPS arena shooter that combines the historical setting of World War II with an arcade twist, delivering frantic gunfights, instant respawns, and total freedom in how you gear up.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177070/extras/b1839b3b9d12cccac51b4b17e42e4b30.avif?t=1738975539\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-stop, fast-paced combat</strong> \u2013 The action never slows down. Sprint, shoot, and respawn as quickly as you fall, keeping the gameplay constantly intense and dynamic. Whether you're flanking or charging head-on, there\u2019s no time to breathe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vertical, multi-layered maps</strong> \u2013 Battle across uniquely designed arenas inspired by real WWII locations. From bombed-out cities to underground bunkers, each map offers vertical gameplay and dynamic layouts that keep players on their toes. Master the environment to gain the upper hand!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vibrant low-poly visuals</strong> \u2013 Forget gritty realism \u2013 <i>Frontline Inferno</i> delivers the war in bright, bold, and colorful low-poly graphics that bring a playful and approachable vibe to the intensity of the action. It\u2019s World War II like you\u2019ve never seen it before.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable characters</strong> \u2013 Stand out from the crowd with a variety of customization options. From helmets and uniforms to accessories, personalize your soldier's look and hit the battlefield in style.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177070/extras/e9f5ded1e6f836399a56a8246fc6ff1a.avif?t=1738975539\" width=616 height=180 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience frantic multiplayer deathmatches where you choose your side in a battle between Axis, Soviets, and Allies. Join the fight in team-based skirmishes across small, intense maps designed for high-octane combat. No complex strategies \u2013 just raw, arcade action.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177070/extras/6e886195ce00811648796e351725b1e4.avif?t=1738975539\" width=616 height=180 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Frontline Inferno</i> is perfect for players who crave fast-paced, skill-based shooters with a nostalgic arcade feel. Ideal for both casual gamers looking to jump into quick, action-packed sessions and FPS veterans who love chaotic, no-holds-barred gameplay.</p>",
